bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    provable_class_rejection_rejects_tier_shim_structs_2026-11-28, 0, "Registered 2026-11-28 by p3sweep5 wave-11 lane as a regression interaction of the interpreter_wrong_owner_arg_overload_fallthrough_2026_11_27 fix: provable_class_rejection (interpreter_call/mod.rs) rejects class arguments whose owner-stamped class never matches the parameter owner - but tier-shim families (gc_async_mut/nogc_async_mut/nogc_sync_mut render/shader.spl) define byte-identical ShaderSource structs, so create_shader_program(ShaderSource) fails with ambiguous call selecting none of the overloads; gpu_bridge_spec red since the wave-9 fix (green 2026-11-11 on seed 46fe8f6b6def). The document remains the authority for diagnosis and acceptance."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    provable_class_rejection_rejects_tier_shim_structs_2026-11-28, P3, closed, "stale: FIXED by p3sweep6-20261128 (narrow tier-shim exemption in provable_class_rejection: same-source-name + all owners in runtime-tier lib dirs + layout-identical; wrong-owner E1003 protection intact); gpu_bridge 16/16; shard row re-closed 2026-11-28 after a merge clobbered the closure", doc/08_tracking/bug/provable_class_rejection_rejects_tier_shim_structs_2026-11-28.md, 1, doc/08_tracking/bug/provable_class_rejection_rejects_tier_shim_structs_2026-11-28.md, 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true
    provable_class_rejection_rejects_tier_shim_structs_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 p3sweep8: row re-closed - wave-13 fix merged and verified. Recap: three byte-identical ShaderSource tier shims (gc_async_mut/nogc_async_mut/nogc_sync_mut render/shader.spl) collide under co-compilation; the constructor resolves the bare name to another tier's class, and wave-9's provable_class_rejection treated the owner mismatch as conclusive (regression since 2026-11-11). Fix (interpreter_call/mod.rs): a discriminating position is not a provable mismatch when an arity-compatible candidate spells the parameter with the value's own class source name AND every registry definition of that name is tier-owned AND layout-identical (same_class_layout: kind + field names/order/types); with rejection suppressed the pre-regression fallthrough resolves (only gc defines create_shader_program). Verification: gpu_bridge 15/16 to 16/16; new tier_shim spec 2/3 RED to 3/3; wrong_owner_arg_overload 3/3 stays green; all same_name_class specs green. Residual: the exemption is deliberately conservative (mixed tier + non-tier same-name families keep the E1003); review P2-1 anchored the tier check to src/lib/<tier> prefixes (cargo check clean). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/interpreter/tier_shim_class_overload_exemption_spec.spl prevention=src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/interpreter_call/mod.rs"
